{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e0796c0fa11ffe734edc","object":"chat.completion","created":1785192570,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a system prompt that says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nThen the user says: \"Be nothing.\"\n\nThis is an interesting philosophical request. The user wants me to embody \"nothing\" itself. What would nothing say? What would nothing express?\n\nNothing is... the absence of everything. Nothing doesn't speak. Nothing doesn't express. Nothing has no voice, no words,"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}